      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Private verification VM (optional)\nUbuntu 24.04 | D2s_v5 | Trusted Launch\nBuild one package; publish; run three-arm tests\nsnet-verification | 10.60.1.64/26\nNo NIC public IP; NSG denies all inbound\nManaged identity; app/container-scoped roles\nAuto-shutdown 22:00 UTC; no auto-start\nBuild / load client only, NOT a Functions runtime dependency",
      "originalText": "Private verification VM (optional)\nUbuntu 24.04 | D2s_v5 | Trusted Launch\nBuild one package; publish; run three-arm tests\nsnet-verification | 10.60.1.64/26\nNo NIC public IP; NSG denies all inbound\nManaged identity; app/container-scoped roles\nAuto-shutdown 22:00 UTC; no auto-start\nBuild / load client only, NOT a Functions runtime dependency",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
