      "text": "Runner -> private sites / SCM\nHTTPS + function-key header\nFlex / Dedicated: publish via SCM\nEP: immutable private Blob package\n\nWarm baseline / idle observation /\nburst scale-out on all three arms\n\nVNet: 10.60.0.0/22\nSix NSG-associated subnets",
      "originalText": "Runner -> private sites / SCM\nHTTPS + function-key header\nFlex / Dedicated: publish via SCM\nEP: immutable private Blob package\n\nWarm baseline / idle observation /\nburst scale-out on all three arms\n\nVNet: 10.60.0.0/22\nSix NSG-associated subnets",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
