      "updated": 1791990257832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure Load Testing (legacy option)\nJMeter: Flex + Dedicated only\nsnet-loadtest | 10.60.2.0/24\nUses their sites private endpoints\nExisting JMeter script excludes EP\nThree-arm runs use the private VM",
      "originalText": "Azure Load Testing (legacy option)\nJMeter: Flex + Dedicated only\nsnet-loadtest | 10.60.2.0/24\nUses their sites private endpoints\nExisting JMeter script excludes EP\nThree-arm runs use the private VM",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
