      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Alternative public site / SCM access\nCorporate IP/CIDR allowlist retained\nNot used by private verification\n\nThe name \"premium\" in legacy code\nstill identifies Dedicated P0v3.",
      "originalText": "Alternative public site / SCM access\nCorporate IP/CIDR allowlist retained\nNot used by private verification\n\nThe name \"premium\" in legacy code\nstill identifies Dedicated P0v3.",
