      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "snet-pe: 10.60.1.0/26 | 3 sites PEs + 9 storage PEs\nVNet-linked DNS: privatelink.azurewebsites.net + blob / queue / table\nFile DNS zone retained; EP does not use Azure Files.\nEach app identity: Blob Data Owner + Queue/Table Data Contributor",
      "originalText": "snet-pe: 10.60.1.0/26 | 3 sites PEs + 9 storage PEs\nVNet-linked DNS: privatelink.azurewebsites.net + blob / queue / table\nFile DNS zone retained; EP does not use Azure Files.\nEach app identity: Blob Data Owner + Queue/Table Data Contributor",
