      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791990257832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Comparison outputs\nInvocation latency / p50 / p95 / p99\nThroughput / errors / lifecycle IDs\nPrivate durable results: startupresults\nPlatform metrics corroborate scale-out\n\nFirst-in-process != proven cold start\nNo per-request prewarmed attribution\nUnequal scaling ceilings: 40 / 3 / 1",
      "originalText": "Comparison outputs\nInvocation latency / p50 / p95 / p99\nThroughput / errors / lifecycle IDs\nPrivate durable results: startupresults\nPlatform metrics corroborate scale-out\n\nFirst-in-process != proven cold start\nNo per-request prewarmed attribution\nUnequal scaling ceilings: 40 / 3 / 1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "design-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1850,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 200.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 44,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791990257832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FLOW LEGEND\nBlue: private requests / host storage\nTeal: runner Blob writes / permitted egress\nPurple dotted: application telemetry\nGray dashed: Azure control-plane management\n\nEP package bootstrap precedes EP compute creation.\nVM is an executor, not part of the application runtime.",
      "originalText": "FLOW LEGEND\nBlue: private requests / host storage\nTeal: runner Blob writes / permitted egress\nPurple dotted: application telemetry\nGray dashed: Azure control-plane management\n\nEP package bootstrap precedes EP compute creation.\nVM is an executor, not part of the application runtime.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
