      "updated": 1791990257832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extended verification topology | Configuration verified 2026-10-14; not a live inventory. Optional EP, runner, load testing and private endpoints are configurable.\nSources: infra/*.tf | docs/DEPLOYMENT-RUNBOOK.md | docs/STARTUP-COMPARISON.md | scripts/private-verification.py | Official Microsoft Azure V24 icons.",
      "originalText": "Extended verification topology | Configuration verified 2026-10-14; not a live inventory. Optional EP, runner, load testing and private endpoints are configurable.\nSources: infra/*.tf | docs/DEPLOYMENT-RUNBOOK.md | docs/STARTUP-COMPARISON.md | scripts/private-verification.py | Official Microsoft Azure V24 icons.",
